# Tier-1 Trade Evaluation Team — hourly on the :05 mark.
#
# Spec (`trading_feedback.md §6`) suggests 1-min cadence; we run hourly
# because outcome_ingestion's sweep is hourly too (see outcome_ingestion.cron)
# -- running more often is idle work, and 1-min would burn ~2900 cycles/day.
# Operator can tune (Tier-1 is deterministic, no LLM, so cost is tiny).

5 * * * * cd /opt/autonomous_trading && bash infra/scripts/run_evaluation.sh >> /var/log/autonomous_trading/evaluation.log 2>&1
